On Jan 5, 2012, at 5:04 PM, Daniel Chapsky wrote:

> Hi all,
> 
> I was wondering if its possible to change pre-loaded data from an RServe (at the server level as opposed to individual client instances). I've noted that the paper on FastRWeb http://urbanek.info/research/pub/urbanek-iasc08.pdf said the answer to my question is no, but was curious if that's changed. If it's still not possible, could anybody given me some pointers as to how I could implement this functionality myself?
