On Jan 17, 2012, at 5:28 AM, Víctor Pascual Cid wrote:

> Hi there,
> 
> while there exists the method asDoubleMatrix to retrieve a matrix from a REXP, there is no way to check if the object is, in fact, a matrix.
> Is this something missing in the package or it assumes that we should check this using R (REngine.eval("is.matrix"....).
> Perhaps I am missing another way to do it!
> 

Matrix is defined in R by having dimension of the length 2, so the code would be something like

int dim = x.dim();
if (dim != null && dim.length == 2) { // this is a matrix ... }

Cheers,
Simon

